  "title": "Grilled Dill Pickle Chicken Thighs",
  "description": "This recipe for chicken marinated in pickle juice yields some tender grilled chicken, so save the juice the next time you reach for the last pickle.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
